<title>UK: Warner Village planning European expansion.</title>
<headline>Warner Village planning European expansion.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warner Village, a movie theatre chain partly owned by Time Warner Inc., said Thursday that it planned a huge expansion programme across Europe.</p>
<p>The company said it would build more than 300 new multiplex theatres with 3,000 screens by the year 2000, creating some 30,000 jobs.</p>
<p>The company, a joint venture between Time Warner's Warner Bros unit and Village Roadshow of Australia, already has 17 multiplexes in Britain.</p>
